    you once again for all your help in saving my home!\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Bl\xE1ith\xEDn\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":24}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":332.9285,\"yPos\":277.7143},\"ID\":20,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"You
    could have done more.\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Bl\xE1ith\xEDn\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":26}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":620.92865,\"yPos\":144.7143},\"ID\":21,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Don't
